{
    "title": "Web Master: Stickman Superhero",
    "description": "In this thrilling mobile hyper-casual game, you take on the role of a heroic stickman who has mastered the art of shooting webs and teleporting to different locations. Armed with your trusty spiderweb-shooting abilities, you must navigate through a series of challenging obstacles and destroy enemies in your path.\r\n\r\nAs you progress through the game, you'll encounter increasingly difficult challenges that will test your skills as a master stickman. You'll need to be quick on your feet and strategic in your movements if you hope to make it to the end of each level.\r\n\r\nTo help you along the way, you can use your web-shooting abilities to swing from platform to platform and avoid obstacles. You can also use your teleportation powers to quickly move around the map and dodge enemy attacks.\r\n\r\nBut beware \u2013 your enemies are not easily defeated. They'll come at you with all sorts of weapons and traps, so you'll need to be on your guard at all times. Use your skills and quick reflexes to dodge their attacks and take them down before they can do any damage.\r\n\r\nWith its fast-paced action, challenging gameplay, and stunning graphics, this mobile hyper-casual game is sure to keep you entertained for hours on end. So what are you waiting for? Grab your web-shooter and start jumping, swinging, and teleporting your way to victory!",
    "descriptionHTML": "In this thrilling mobile hyper-casual game, you take on the role of a heroic stickman who has mastered the art of shooting webs and teleporting to different locations. Armed with your trusty spiderweb-shooting abilities, you must navigate through a series of challenging obstacles and destroy enemies in your path.<br><br>As you progress through the game, you&#39;ll encounter increasingly difficult challenges that will test your skills as a master stickman. You&#39;ll need to be quick on your feet and strategic in your movements if you hope to make it to the end of each level.<br><br>To help you along the way, you can use your web-shooting abilities to swing from platform to platform and avoid obstacles. You can also use your teleportation powers to quickly move around the map and dodge enemy attacks.<br><br>But beware \u2013 your enemies are not easily defeated. They&#39;ll come at you with all sorts of weapons and traps, so you&#39;ll need to be on your guard at all times. Use your skills and quick reflexes to dodge their attacks and take them down before they can do any damage.<br><br>With its fast-paced action, challenging gameplay, and stunning graphics, this mobile hyper-casual game is sure to keep you entertained for hours on end. So what are you waiting for? Grab your web-shooter and start jumping, swinging, and teleporting your way to victory!",
    "summary": "Shoot the web, jump and teleport! Be a stickman hero and destroy your enemies!",
